<title>PHILIPPINES: Seafront to invest 100 mln peso in project.</title>
<headline>Seafront to invest 100 mln peso in project.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seafront Resources Corp said on Thursday its board had approved a plan to invest up to 100 million pesos for the development of a 600-hectare mixed-use industrial and residential estate southwest of Manila.</p>
<p>Assistant vice president Arturo Maulion told the Philippine Stock Exchange in a statement that a new company would be organised to develop, market and manage the zone in Hermosa in Bataan.</p>
<p>&quot;The project will be comprised of a light industrial estate (300 hectares) a golf course/club and mini-town centre (90 hectares) and residential communities (210 hectares),&quot; Maulion said.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
